{
  "title": "Yellow Spiced Kenyan Seafood Curry",
  "description": "A comforting and aromatic Kenyan dish featuring seafood stock, tadka, and a blend of herbal spices, made gluten-free-friendly for all to enjoy. This curry is perfect for a cold evening.",
